    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Pingu at the wedding party: It is excitement all around when a wedding invitation arrives and the Pingu family make their way to the gathering. However, things do not go quite as planned with an absentee groom, a new arrival and the havoc wreaked by a damaged gift. But all ends well and by the end of the day Pingu has made a firm new friend of one of his cousins. Also contains two more stories about Pingu, the little penguin, teaching children various values</marc:subfield>
